{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "name": "garrick",
  "start": "n22",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Garrick",
      "text": "Go on. The dark has nothing on you."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Garrick",
      "text": "The dummy, little scribble. Click, or J. It won't hit back. That's the whole appeal."
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Garrick",
      "text": "You've got a lantern. Good. A lantern is how you tell the dark what matters.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Garrick",
      "text": "But light doesn't swing back. For that...",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[i]He sets a feather on the anvil and takes the hammer to its nib. Four clean strikes. No bending.[/i]",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Garrick",
      "text": "A Quill. Not a sword. A sword ends things. This one rewrites them.",
      "next": "n7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Garrick",
      "text": "Go on. Hit the dummy. Three times. Don't think about whether it's pretty.",
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "set",
      "variable": "has_quill",
      "op": "set",
      "value": 1,
      "next": "n9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Received: Garrick's Quill"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "branch",
      "if": {
        "kind": "variable",
        "name": "has_quill",
        "op": ">=",
        "value": 1
      },
      "then": "n2",
      "else": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "branch",
      "if": {
        "kind": "variable",
        "name": "lesson_done",
        "op": ">=",
        "value": 1
      },
      "then": "n1",
      "else": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "set",
      "variable": "play_k_garrick",
      "op": "set",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Lorem Ipsum",
      "text": "Lorem... ipsum...",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[i]The frozen flame in his forge is still waiting. Touch it.[/i]"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Lorem Ipsum",
      "text": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "Lorem Ipsum",
      "text": "...consectetur. Horseshoe? Horseshoe.",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[i]He is not a person right now. He is a placeholder holding a hammer.[/i]",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[i]But the forge behind him is holding something, too. Its fire is frozen in a single moment. He cannot let go of it, and he cannot remember it.[/i]",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "set",
      "variable": "met_garrick",
      "op": "set",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "branch",
      "if": {
        "kind": "variable",
        "name": "met_garrick",
        "op": ">=",
        "value": 1
      },
      "then": "n13",
      "else": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "branch",
      "if": {
        "kind": "variable",
        "name": "memory_done",
        "op": ">=",
        "value": 1
      },
      "then": "n12",
      "else": "n20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "branch",
      "if": {
        "kind": "variable",
        "name": "restored_garrick",
        "op": ">=",
        "value": 1
      },
      "then": "n11",
      "else": "n21"
    }
  ]
}
